{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如此这般，依照安洁的指示，有许多学生参加的蛋糕制作计划顺利进行着。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "如此这般，依照安洁的指示，有许多学生参加的蛋糕制作计划顺利进行着。", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
