{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「收到。那么装饰制作组的各位，请立即着手制作！」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「收到。那么装饰制作组的各位，请立即着手制作！」", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2643", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我这边就继续对账了」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4122", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，那就麻烦了！这个也很重要呢」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "「好的，那就麻烦了！这个也很重要呢」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2644", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么装饰制作组的各位，请看我～把刚刚送到的可可拿在手上，开始制作形状吧～！就这样这样再这样」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "「那么装饰制作组的各位，请看我～把刚刚送到的可可拿在手上，开始制作形状吧～！就这样这样再这样」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2645", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好快！而且好会做啊！安洁你这个我们可学不了啊～」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「好快！而且好会做啊！安洁你这个我们可学不了啊～」", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0072", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呼呼—样品其实是那边那个，果然该给你们看看高手的水平呢」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": "「呜呼呼—样品其实是那边那个，果然该给你们看看高手的水平呢」", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2646", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了～有问题的话请随时提出哦～」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2647", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「巧克力塑形，听起来好像需要加塑料进去呢」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1024", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这可不算问题吧？！你昨天也看到了，加入的是麦芽糖和糖浆哟」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「这可不算问题吧？！你昨天也看到了，加入的是麦芽糖和糖浆哟」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2648", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看着装饰制作组的样子，擦了擦汗，自言自语地说道。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "我看着装饰制作组的样子，擦了擦汗，自言自语地说道。", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为安洁是女仆，平时基本上都是照着大家说的做……", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "因为安洁是女仆，平时基本上都是照着大家说的做……", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能是因为太喜欢照顾人了吧，像这样指导大家，总感觉有点奇妙。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "可能是因为太喜欢照顾人了吧，像这样指导大家，总感觉有点奇妙。", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～又看到了喜欢的人的另一面啊……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「嗯～又看到了喜欢的人的另一面啊……」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，请给安洁一点时间」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "「……抱歉，请给安洁一点时间」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2649", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2650", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时，安洁抽出身，向我走来。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "此时，安洁抽出身，向我走来。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「您的头发乱了哦。必须得要擦擦汗呢」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「您的头发乱了哦。必须得要擦擦汗呢」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2651", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这么忙的时候，安洁也没忘了她是我的女仆。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "在这么忙的时候，安洁也没忘了她是我的女仆。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁拿出手帕，一边帮我整理头发，一边帮我擦去额头上的汗水。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "安洁拿出手帕，一边帮我整理头发，一边帮我擦去额头上的汗水。", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，哎嘿嘿，这样又是平时帅气的少爷了」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2652", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈……谢谢你特地来帮我。抱歉啊，占用了你的时间」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「哈哈……谢谢你特地来帮我。抱歉啊，占用了你的时间」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
