{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是也不错啊，像新婚夫妇一样。安洁也是一副很有精神的样子呢」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「但是也不错啊，像新婚夫妇一样。安洁也是一副很有精神的样子呢」", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0073", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……抱歉，占用的时间太长了。真的谢谢你，安洁」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "「嗯……抱歉，占用的时间太长了。真的谢谢你，安洁」", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
